  "steps": [
    "Mix all the mushroom ingredients except the mushrooms in a large bowl, then add the mushrooms and toss until coated. Set aside.",
    "Slaw: blend the yogurt, coriander, jalapeños and jalapeño juice into a thick sauce, then mix in the cabbage.",
    "Mix the chipotle mayo ingredients.",
    "Cook the mushrooms on a very hot griddle pan, pressing down with a spatula to release moisture, until deeply browned and charred on both sides. Stack and slice.",
    "Fill the flatbreads with slaw and mushrooms, drizzle with the mayo and top with pickled onions and coriander."
